<p class=3D"ltx_p" id=3D"S4.p2.4"><span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_font_bold" id=
=3D"S4.p2.4.1">Observation 1: RLMs can scale to the 10M+ token regime and c=
an outperform base LMs and existing task-agnostic agent scaffolds on long c=
