<section class=3D"ltx_subsection" id=3D"A3.SS2">
<h3 class=3D"ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">
<span class=3D"ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Summary agent baselin=
e</h3><button class=3D"sr-only button" style=3D"display: none;">Report issu=
e for preceding element</button>
<div class=3D"ltx_para" id=3D"A3.SS2.p1">
<p class=3D"ltx_p" id=3D"A3.SS2.p1.1">The summarization agent baseline foll=
ows the scaffold presented in &nbsp;<cite class=3D"ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_c=
itet">Sun<span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_bib_etal"> et al.</span> (<a class=3D"=
ltx_ref" href=3D"https://arxiv.org/html/2512.24601v2#bib.bib25" title=3D"Sc=
aling long-horizon llm agent via context-folding">2025</a>); Wu<span class=
=3D"ltx_text ltx_bib_etal"> et al.</span> (<a class=3D"ltx_ref" href=3D"htt=
ps://arxiv.org/html/2512.24601v2#bib.bib5" title=3D"ReSum: unlocking long-h=
orizon search intelligence via context summarization">2025</a>); Yu<span cl=
ass=3D"ltx_text ltx_bib_etal"> et al.</span> (<a class=3D"ltx_ref" href=3D"=
https://arxiv.org/html/2512.24601v2#bib.bib6" title=3D"MemAgent: reshaping =
long-context llm with multi-conv rl-based memory agent">2025</a>)</cite>, w=
hich also mimics how contexts are typically compressed in a multi-turn sett=
ing in agents like Claude Code&nbsp;<cite class=3D"ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_c=
itep">(Anthropic, <a class=3D"ltx_ref" href=3D"https://arxiv.org/html/2512.=
24601v2#bib.bib22" title=3D"Claude code: subagents =E2=80=94 modular ai wor=
kflows with isolated agent contexts">2025</a>)</cite>. In an iterative fash=
ion, the agent is given inputs until its context is full, at which point it=
 is queried to summarize all relevant information and continue. If the agen=
t is given a context in a single step that is larger than its model context=
 window, it chunks up this context and performs the summarization process o=
ver these chunks.</p><button class=3D"sr-only button" style=3D"display: non=
e;">Report issue for preceding element</button>
</div>
<div class=3D"ltx_para" id=3D"A3.SS2.p2">
