e Models"><span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> between GPT-5 a=
nd Qwen3-Coder on BrowseComp+, where the summary agent using Qwen3-Coder is=
 nearly <math alttext=3D"20\times" class=3D"ltx_math_unparsed" display=3D"i=
nline" id=3D"A3.SS2.p2.1.m1" intent=3D":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</m=
n><mo lspace=3D"0.222em">=C3=97</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=3D"applicat=
ion/x-tex">20\times</annotation></semantics></math> more expensive on avera=
