2/trajectories/bcp-74_2-2.png" width=3D"476">
</div>
<div class=3D"ltx_para" id=3D"A5.SS1.p8">
<p class=3D"ltx_p" id=3D"A5.SS1.p8.1"><span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_font_bold=
" id=3D"A5.SS1.p8.1.1">Step 3.</span> After checking the information above,=
 the root LM reasons that it has enough information to answer the query. Th=
e root LM chooses to check its answer again with two additional recursive L=
M calls to confirm that its answer aligns with this check. Finally, the roo=
t LM returns its final answer as =E2=80=98Maria Dalmacio=E2=80=98, which is=
 the correct answer.</p><button class=3D"sr-only button" style=3D"display: =
none;">Report issue for preceding element</button>
</div>
