<p class=3D"ltx_p" id=3D"A5.SS2.p1.1">The total cost of this trajectory was=
 <span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_font_bold" id=3D"A5.SS2.p1.1.1">$1.12</span>. =
In this task, the agent must output all pairs of user IDs satisfying some s=
et of properties given a list of entries (&nbsp;32k tokens total). This is =
both an information dense long input as well as long output task, making it=
 particularly challenging for current LMs.</p><button class=3D"sr-only butt=
on" style=3D"display: none;">Report issue for preceding element</button>
</div>
