 href=3D"https://arxiv.org/html/2512.24601v2#S4.SS1" title=3D"4.1 Emergent =
Patterns in RLM Trajectories =E2=80=A3 4 Results and Discussion =E2=80=A3 R=
ecursive Language Models"><span class=3D"ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4.1</span></=
a>, the runtime for these methods can be significantly improved through asy=
nchrony of LM calls and additional prompting to discourage long sub-LM call=
s or code.</p><button class=3D"sr-only button" style=3D"display: none;">Rep=
ort issue for preceding element</button>
